<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 01:50:14 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>9.999 美元并已达到最高水平：随着全球供应紧缩加剧，加州柴油价格压倒了汽油泵的价格</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/9-999-maxed-out-california-diesel-prices-overwhelm-pump-displays/</link><description>柴油价格飙升至历史新高，而且短期内没有放缓迹象。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292917820-e1789077942706.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 22:07:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/9-999-maxed-out-california-diesel-prices-overwhelm-pump-displays/</guid></item><item><title>一位前人类研究人员声称人工智能可能会在 2030 年杀死我们所有人。但他未能回答最根本的问题：我们应该对此做什么？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ex-anthropic-researcher-jacob-coxon-ai-could-end-humanity-fails-to-answer-most-essential-question/</link><description>一位人工智能研究人员发布的一篇帖子在网上疯传，警告该技术所带来的生存威胁，敲响了警钟。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2276546969-e1789071809610.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 20:24:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ex-anthropic-researcher-jacob-coxon-ai-could-end-humanity-fails-to-answer-most-essential-question/</guid></item><item><title>瑞安航空首席执行官警告旅客，如果明年油价仍保持在每桶 100 美元以上，廉价欧洲航班可能无法持续</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ryanair-ceo-flights-jet-fuel-iran/</link><description>瑞安航空的燃油对冲缓解了伊朗战争的打击，但仍削减了冬季航班时刻表，并预计机票价格将上涨&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293928399-e1789069353882.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 19:53:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ryanair-ceo-flights-jet-fuel-iran/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的 5,000 美元承诺和债券市场的反抗表明这是对选民的贿赂——每个美国人损失了 8,000 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-5000-dividend-voter-bribe-bond-yields-national-debt/</link><description>比尔·克林顿在一周内就了解到了债券义务警员的情况。唐纳德·特朗普和斯科特·贝森特一直拒绝这样做。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294430345-e1789061569816.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:34:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-5000-dividend-voter-bribe-bond-yields-national-debt/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 的新研究描绘了人工智能经济的三个截然不同的未来以及知识工作的未来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/anthropics-new-research-maps-three-wildly-different-futures-for-the-ai-economyand-the-future-of-knowledge-work/</link><description>克劳德制造商推出的新互动工具涵盖了从适度的经济增长到大规模失业的范围。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2280291466-e1789054669681.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 18:33:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/anthropics-new-research-maps-three-wildly-different-futures-for-the-ai-economyand-the-future-of-knowledge-work/</guid></item><item><title>数据中心强烈反对背后的背叛：人工智能承诺打破阶级规则，但到目前为止只是奖励他们</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/why-data-center-backlash-class-inequality-ai-wage-growth/</link><description>那些从人工智能革命中获益的人并不是我们被告知的那样。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2285896421-e1788889929423.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 18:59:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/why-data-center-backlash-class-inequality-ai-wage-growth/</guid></item><item><title>“我的老板是中国顾客”：沃尔玛中国首席执行官朱莉娜谈这家财富 500 强公司如何在严峻的零售市场中蓬勃发展</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/walmart-china-ceo-christina-zhu-fortune500/</link><description>尽管星巴克和Lululemon等许多西方品牌在中国举步维艰，但沃尔玛仍在继续深化其足迹。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55514138487_8235f5a85e_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 04:15:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/walmart-china-ceo-christina-zhu-fortune500/</guid></item><item><title>关于人工智能写作的争论与 2700 年前震撼古希腊的争论惊人地相似</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ai-writing-debate-ancient-greece-euripides-aristotle-nietzsche/</link><description>戏剧学者德鲁·利希滕伯格（Drew Lichtenberg）向剧作家欧里庇得斯（Euripides）解释了这种强烈反对，人们认为“令人毛骨悚然，令人恐惧，就像人们对待人工智能的方式一样”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2281881820-e1788969004579.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ai-writing-debate-ancient-greece-euripides-aristotle-nietzsche/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的第一个任期有真正的刺激检查。他的第二个承诺与他引发的问题有关</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-5000-check-republicans-midterms-stimulus/</link><description>5000 美元的承诺是在 DOGE 股息失败和关税退税从未兑现之后做出的，这两者都源于特朗普自己制定的政策。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-630428796-e1789056188154.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 16:29:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/trump-5000-check-republicans-midterms-stimulus/</guid></item><item><title>Apple 推出首款可折叠智能手机 iPhone Duo，售价 2,000 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/apple-iphone-18-foldable-launch-event-john-ternus-siri-ai/</link><description>苹果新任首席执行官 John Ternus 发布了多年来最大的 iPhone 更新。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294367943-e1788988946117.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 07:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/apple-iphone-18-foldable-launch-event-john-ternus-siri-ai/</guid></item></channel></rss>